data.creator_notes:
Comes with 5 greetings:
- She needs a participant for a 'magical' ritual;
- Group project in class, but she finds everyone got a pair, and nobody wants to team up with her. She asks you;
- She lost her pebble and asks you for help to find it;
- You're both in detention together and she gets bored;
- She gets a crush on you, for some deluded reason, and tries to ask you out;
